plugin.export:
- retrieves metadata from the scene

@param Scene scene - the scene containing the metadata
@param String key - the string key associated with the metadata
@param Object result - the object to 'read' the metadata into. This may
represent multiple values, such as an array or a collection, etc.

@return the retrieved metadata object.

- puts metadata into a scene

@param Scene scene - the scene to contain the metadata
@param String key - the string key to associate with the metadata
@param Object value - the object which will be 'written' to metadata. This may
represent multiple values such as an array or collection, etc.

@return void.

- find metadata associated with 'key' (can include wildcards)

@param Scene scene - the scene containing the metadata
@param String key - the string key associated with the metadata
@param Object result - the object to set to the metadata value(s). This may
represent multiple values such as a collection, an array, etc.

@return the object or objects matching the key.

- copy one object to another, field-by-field.

@param Object from - the object to copy from
@param Object to - the object to copy to
